      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "PDD first proof: keep Sigma Shift at video=12/audio=3, sampler=euler, and wire both MODEL and SIGMAS from PDD Apply. Keep partition_check=error.\n\nPDD pairing: stock REF2VA uses Ref2VA PDD. An FL2VA trunk, including FL2VA plus the reference patch, uses FL2VA PDD. Do not run a family mismatch with partition_check=warn; it can render degraded video.\n\nUse Generate Draft, inspect the preview, then Retry or Accept. After Accept, Append Card, enter a new prompt/seed/duration, and Generate Draft again.\n\nIdentity: click Refresh in the visual Identity Anchor node, choose an accepted card, scrub and pause its video, then click Use Current Frame as Identity. Keep use_identity_anchor enabled on the main node.\n\nTo join the timeline, put the main node on Resume, match the export node's project_name, enable it, and Queue Prompt. It includes accepted cards by default.\n\nReferences in this packet are applied to every card in this fixed REF2VA project."
      ],
      "title": "LongCaster MVP controls"
    },
